      <!--Interaction
      End -->
      <note id="note-00001">
        <title>Why Should I Care?</title>
        
          <media alt="Insert Alt Text">
            <image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/Algebra-1_01_11_02_02.png" width="300"/>
          </media>
        
        <para id="para-00013">Alex's brother can use algebra to budget his paycheck from his job at a pizza place. He uses some money for food, some for going out with his friends, and some, he saves for college.</para>
        <para id="para-00014">If he uses variables to represent the different ways he uses his money, he can put those variables into an equation to make sure he has enough money to last until his next paycheck.</para>
      </note>
    </section>
